<title>EGYPT: Egypt all-share index up 1.28 pct at 17th high.</title>
<headline>Egypt all-share index up 1.28 pct at 17th high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index rose 1.28 percent to another record high of 411.53 points on Wednesday, brokers and the Capital Market Authority (CMA) said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the index rose 5.19 points from 406.34 points on Tuesday, which was also a record. Wednesday's level is the 17th consecutive closing high.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
